 "note": "The judge compares every storage step of the management programs (the Admin and Firebase object reads and writes around each compile, release switch and no-release step) between the local run and the production projection, whole: status, body bytes and digest, content-type, content-length, x-content-type-options and cache-control. The other step kinds are validated against the condition on each side. The judge's hard-coded gap MISSING_PRODUCTION_INVALID_INSTALLED_IDENTITY_AND_EFFECTIVE_WITNESS is not a closure condition: owner-delegated ruling 809(4) takes recording c (release absent before, invalid :test refused with 200 and issues, release absent after) as the observation that an invalid compile leaves the effective release unchanged."
